---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Master plan | Aura Homes"
  description="Beautiful second-life rooms that bring people back to nature, one room at a time."
  descriptor="Master plan"
>
  <main id="top" class="plan">
    <section class="page-lead">
      <div data-rise>
        <p class="story-kicker">Master plan</p>
        <h1>A plan, told slowly.</h1>
        <p class="story-lede">
          The room is what you can ask for now. Everything after it is a direction, held lightly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="plan-track">
      <div class="plan-spine" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <ol class="plan-rail">
        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">01</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Now</p>
            <h2><span class="plan-keep">Second-life</span> rooms.</h2>
            <p>
              Beautiful second-life rooms, Hot Take tub units, and customs, made one at a time. Off-grid and solar builds are available.
            </p>
            <p class="plan-links">
              <a href="/rooms">Rooms</a>
              <a href="/pre-order?model=hot-take">Hot Take</a>
              <a href="/customs">Customs</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">02</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Grow</p>
            <h2>Rooms that would grow.</h2>
            <p>
              Root Access grow rooms and aeroponic units would follow, as Aura Farms. The same room, with one long side turned toward a living wall.
            </p>
            <p class="plan-links">
              <a href="/farms">Aura Farms</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">03</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Water</p>
            <h2>Drawn from the air.</h2>
            <p>
              Atmospheric water units would come later, after more research, and they are not ready to place. Aura H2O would be offered in premium cans and glass, with ethical sponsors only.
            </p>
            <p class="plan-links">
              <a href="/water">Water</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">04</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Give</p>
            <h2>An intention to share.</h2>
            <p>
              The hope is free food and free water, beginning with food banks and anyone in need in Edmonton. It is an intention, not a promise, and it is not operating.
            </p>
            <p class="plan-links">
              <a href="/journal/free-food-and-water">The note</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">05</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Stay</p>
            <h2>Near the mountains.</h2>
            <p>
              Micro-resorts, about half an hour from Banff and Canmore, would be built as showcases for the newest rooms. Net decks, wood-fired tubs, and a long look at the stars.
            </p>
            <p class="plan-links">
              <a href="/resorts">Resorts</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">06</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Paradise</p>
            <h2>Costa Rica, our second home.</h2>
            <p>
              Building in harmony with nature comes easier there. The same care would go there when the work is ready.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="plan-step" data-rise>
          <div class="plan-mark">
            <p class="plan-num" aria-hidden="true">07</p>
            <span class="plan-node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-copy">
            <p class="story-kicker">Home</p>
            <h2>Full eco homes, someday.</h2>
            <p>
              Whole houses would come last, after the rooms have taught the rest. Still quiet, and still close to the ground.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="plan-close" data-rise>One room at a time. Then a little more.</p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .plan {
    color: #14120e;
  }
  .plan-track {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2vh 8vw 4vh;
  }
  .plan-spine {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    top: 6vh;
    bottom: 8vh;
    left: calc(8vw + 6.25rem);
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent,
      rgba(156, 122, 85, 0.55) 10%,
      rgba(156, 122, 85, 0.55) 90%,
      transparent
    );
    transform-origin: top center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .plan-rail {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .plan-step {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6.25rem minmax(0, 38rem);
    column-gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 11vh 0;
  }
  .plan-mark {
    position: relative;
  }
  .plan-num {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-cinzel);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.6vw, 2.35rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #9c7a55;
  }
  .plan-node {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 1;
    top: 0.48rem;
    right: -3.5px;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #f4f3ef;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #9c7a55;
  }
  .plan-copy h2 {
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    max-width: 11em;
    font-family: var(--font-cinzel);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 4.8vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .plan-keep {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .plan-copy > p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(20, 18, 14, 0.78);
  }
  .plan-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
  .plan-links a {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #8a6a45;
    transition: opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .plan-links a:hover {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .plan-close {
    margin: 8vh 8vw 20vh calc(8vw + 6.25rem + 3rem);
    max-width: 12em;
    font-family: var(--font-cinzel);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.6vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .plan-track {
      padding: 0 1.5rem 2vh;
    }
    .plan-spine {
      left: calc(1.5rem + 0.15rem);
      top: 4vh;
      bottom: 4vh;
    }
    .plan-step {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      row-gap: 1.15rem;
      padding: 8vh 0 8vh 1.65rem;
    }
    .plan-mark {
      position: static;
    }
    .plan-node {
      top: calc(8vh + 0.42rem);
      right: auto;
      left: 0.15rem;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
    .plan-close {
      margin: 5vh 1.5rem 16vh 3.15rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .plan-links a {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { gsap, ScrollTrigger, prefersReducedMotion } from '../scripts/motion';

  const page = document.querySelector('.plan');
  if (page && !prefersReducedMotion()) {
    ScrollTrigger.getAll()
      .filter((trigger) => trigger.vars.id === 'plan-rise')
      .forEach((trigger) => trigger.kill());

    gsap.utils.toArray<HTMLElement>('[data-rise]', page).forEach((el) => {
      gsap.from(el, {
        y: 22,
        opacity: 0,
        duration: 1.85,
        ease: 'power3.out',
        scrollTrigger: {
          id: 'plan-rise',
          trigger: el,
          start: 'top 90%',
          once: true,
        },
      });
    });

    const settle = () => ScrollTrigger.refresh();
    requestAnimationFrame(settle);
    window.addEventListener('load', settle, { once: true });
  }
</script>
